About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

Role Summary and Impact &nbsp;

As part of the Global Operations Centre (GOC) , you will work closely with teams across the United States, Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact solutions in a collaborative, multicultural environment. We are looking for an Activation Pod Lead&nbsp;who will: &nbsp;

• Strategic Client Leadership &amp; Commercial Growth: Act as the senior client lead for HVCS engagements, managing C-suite relationships, driving organic revenue growth, and providing executive oversight of end-to-end addressable campaign delivery across LATAM and US accounts. &nbsp;

• Hub Leadership &amp; Operational Excellence: Lead, mentor, and develop a multidisciplinary pod (Orchestrators, Strategists, Data/Identity Specialists), overseeing workload allocation, governance, and quality standards across all client workstreams. &nbsp;

• New Business &amp; Thought Leadership: Lead HVCS workstreams in commercial pitches and proposals while championing workshops, case studies, and market enablement to drive widespread addressable adoption. &nbsp;

• AI Innovation &amp; Global Integration: Drive team and client adoption of WPP Open and generative AI tools, optimizing tech partner workflows while connecting the Mexico Hub with global HVCS leadership to align standards and best practices. &nbsp;

