• Commercial Acumen: Demonstrated ability to drive organic business expansion, identify growth opportunities, and contribute to commercial targets and pitches. &nbsp;

• Addressable &amp; Tech Literacy: Strong strategic and technical understanding of DCO platforms, ad serving, addressable media channels, and campaign activation workflows. &nbsp;

